window.products.push({"id":770125,"name":"The Original Nag Champa by Ganesha Incense - Premium Natural Ayurvedic Incense Sticks (100g / 3.5oz) Made in India by Artisan Incense Makers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fxaGGAHBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Nag Champa Nag Champa, the classic scent that it is, needs no introduction. Instead, here are a few excerpts from Mike McLatchey's review of Ganesha Incense's Nag Champa at ORS:   \"I’d easily think about this as the market’s go-to Nag Champa\".   \"I actually found myself enjoying this MORE with every stick, rather than less, which is not often the case.\" About This Incense Line These are natural Indian incense sticks handmade using high quality materials including resins, essential oils, honey, woods, and herbs... They are manufactured according to centuries-old traditional Ayurvedic recipes.   The pack contains 100 grams (3.5oz) or approximately 80 sticks. Therefore, unlike other brands' sample-sized boxes of 15-20 grams, ours will offer you an abundance of divine fragrance to savour and enjoy to your heart’s content.   Our packaging is biodegradable and made from recycled paper. About Ganesha Incense Company This company grew out of our founder's love for great Indian incense. As such, we will always strive to bring you the most amazing incense experience India has to offer at the best possible prices.   And in doing so, we care dearly about the deeper meaning and effects of our business. We believe everything we do, for money or not, should be deeply rooted in our wider spiritual mission. That is why we constantly work on optimising our operations so that we can improve life on Earth, and not make it worse just for the sake of financial profit.   This is a part of our ambitious vision for the future in which companies actively work on protecting and beautifying the Earth. By buying our products you are actively supporting this vision and we thank you for that!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fxaGGAHBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ganesha Incense","source_asin":"B01B0AB764","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770125","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B0AB764","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B0AB764","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
