window.products.push({"id":770160,"name":"Chic Sharpener Professional Knife Sharpener 3-in-1Knife-sharpening System | Sharpens Both Steel & Ceramic Knives in All Sizes in Blue (Includes a FREE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612Wq8z797L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your ceramic and steel knives sharp with the 3-stage sharpener. With three to four strokes of the knife along the sharpening precision rod, you'll have a brand new knife with a sharpened edge. It works on kitchen knives, small hunting or survival kit knives, and blades of all size, shape or style. Whether you're a professional chef, or simply love to cook, you know the importance of having a well-sharpened knife in your kitchen. Even the most expensive knife won't be up to the task of carving a turkey or even cutting an apple if it doesn't have a sharp, precise blade. More importantly is the fact that a dull blade is dangerous to use and should be avoided. That's why it's important to keep your knives in optimal condition by regularly sharpening them using a tool that's easy to use in order to prevent damage. The 3-Stage Knife Sharpener is easy to use, so you won't have to worry about whether you're using the right technique and hand motions to sharpen without damaging it. The perfectly angled rods ensure a razor sharp edge on any ceramic, coarse or fine knife. Pull the knife through the mechanism three to four times for a razor-sharp edge every time you sharpen. Triple-action sharpener that sharpens ceramic knives, dull blades and hones edges. Sharpens ceramic, steel knives and even the dullest of blades. Perfect for use on kitchen knives, hunting and survival knives. Made with ABS plastic and features rubber feet that offer stability and prevent marks on the countertop.  Duradble handling makes for safety while in use. Sharpen your knives regularly and your knives will last you for decades. Ready to buy? Click the ‘Add to Cart’ button to order your 3-stage knife sharpener today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612Wq8z797L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chic Sharpener","source_asin":"B0194L5U2S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0194L5U2S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0194L5U2S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
