window.products.push({"id":770335,"name":"Small Trash Bags, 1.2 Gallon Drawstring Trash Bags AYOTEE Bathroom Trash Bags, 75 Counts Ultra Strong Unscented Garbage Bags Waste Basket Liners for B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QI8FLlIsS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【75 Counts Small Drawstring Trash Bags】25 counts of 3 rolls 1 gallon Drawstring Trash Bags. Our small garbage bags with handles drawstring design, which helps you to tie and lift the kitchen trash bags more convenient. By using the drawstring garbage bags, you don't need to worry about the trash dirty your hands again or dropping garbage in your house because of bursting accident. ✔【Functional 1.2 Gallon Gabarge Bags】Size of the mini trash bags that is 13.7*15.7 inches/35*40cm(L*H) which fits most round trash cans whose top bottom diameter and height within 10*12 inches, and square trash bins whose length and height within 10*13 inches. Please check the measurements of both our small bathroom trash bags and your 5 liter,1,1.2,1.3 gal trash can to ensure that they fit well. ✔【Tear & Leak Resistant Small Trash Bags】Our waste basket trash bags with durable drawstring handles which is designed for lock the smell and lift easily when it is fasten with a drawstring. Then you will find that our small trash bag liners though small but thick enough for storing daily waste. It prevent rips and tears, not easy to pierce but avoiding sharp stuffs as much as possible. ✔【Multi-purpose 5 Liter Trash Bags】These mini garbage bags with break-point design, it’s not easy to break when you tear off the office trash bags along the dotted line. They are fit for office, kitchen, living room, bedroom, bathroom and so on. These 1.2 gallon trash bags also can be used as baby diaper trash bag, dog poop bags or car trash bag. These small garbage bags are translucent, which help us to identify the content of the garbage so as to better sort the garbage. ✔【No Bad Smell 】These small Trash Bags are tested strictly before they are sent out. They are made of Plastarch material(PSM), which is based on natural renewable plant starch extract. You can rest assured that these small trash bag unscented, non-toxic and pure. If you have any questions of our compost small trash bags, please feel free to contact with us. Truly dedicated to your satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QI8FLlIsS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AYOTEE","source_asin":"B08TZX5X42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TZX5X42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TZX5X42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
