window.products.push({"id":770417,"name":"ICONIQ Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Water Bottle with Pop Up Straw Cap, 17 Ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V2v8nCXNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stay refreshed and hydrated all day long with the ICONIQ Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Sports Water Bottle, now including our patented and easy-to-use pop up straw lid! The sleek cola bottle design is compact and convenient, 10.1\" in height, 2.8\" in diameter, and only 11 ounces in weight, with a 17 ounce (or 500 ml) capacity. It fits comfortably in the cup holder in your car, the water bottle holder on your bicycle, or the water bottle pouch on your backpack, or wherever you want it to go. The double walled stainless steel construction provides long lasting insulation for both hot and cold drinks. Hot drinks stay hot for 12 hours, cold drinks stay cold for 24 hours. The double walled design also ensures no sweating or condensation. Perfectly suited for storage in your purse, gym bag, or book bag with no damp mess. Unlike plastic water bottles, the ICONIQ water bottle is crafted from 18-8 food grade stainless steel and contains absolutely no hazardous BPAs whatsoever. Bottle includes our patented pop up straw cap which lets you sip directly from the bottle without the clumsy hassle of removing the cap! Pop open the straw when you want to take a sip and fold it away when done for secure leak-proof storage!  Both standard and pop up straw lids are included. Each of our water bottles is built to last a lifetime and is covered by our Lifetime Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V2v8nCXNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICONIQ","source_asin":"B08DTG2MW5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DTG2MW5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DTG2MW5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":770418,"name":"LMZ CH Furniture 71\" Tufted Velvet Rolled Arm Upholstered Bench with Toss Pillows Entryway Ottoman for Foot of Bed, Window, Entryway, Soft Fabric Bols","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DcYuP183L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE ART OF RELAXATION No space is ever unfit for the addition of a super soft seating choice. The secret behind a perfect piece of furniture is the amount of comfort and functionality it can provide while making a statement at the same time. We at the CH Furniture store created this balance of fashion and function with our exquisite upholstered benches. A FINE PIECE OF DECOR With tall armrests, luxurious velvety texture, and deep buttons, these benches for bedroom present a vintage self-contained look, ideal for placement at the center or by the wall. Place our stunning Victorian-style ottomans in your bedroom, living room, hallway, by the window, or at the foot of the bed. A VERSATILE ADDITION Raining outside? It’s time to take a good book and curl up on a comfy chaise lounge indoors! Our tufted benches are sized ideally with ample space to stretch your legs and two bolstered pillows for extra support. This cozy bedroom decor can fit a king-sized bed easily. Perfect to make some extra space to set your pillows at night, a napping point for your furry friends, a seating area for your guests, or an extravagant housewarming gift to spoil a loved one. PRODUCT DETAILS Material: Velvet Fabric, Acrylic Legs Material: Velvet Fabric, Acrylic Legs Dimensions LxWxH: 71 x 29 x 28inches Dimensions LxWxH: 71 x 29 x 28inches Color: Navy Blue, Grey, Beige, Pink Color: Navy Blue, Grey, Beige, Pink Weight: 61lbs Weight: 61lbs Package Includes: 1x Seat, 2x Armrests, 4x Legs, 2x Pillows Package Includes: 1x Seat, 2x Armrests, 4x Legs, 2x Pillows Contact us if you face any issues with our product. We guarantee dedicated customer support and a promise to solve your problems right away!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DcYuP183L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LMZ","source_asin":"B0BD1Q9ZSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD1Q9ZSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD1Q9ZSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
