window.products.push({"id":770449,"name":"Canary Products Tabletop Mist Fountain, Medium, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814gwpDROtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Canary Products continuously comes with new products and promises to make the products affordable with the highest quality. This is the newest model of Canary Product’s tabletop mist fountain. It can decorate your home or office. This item also acts as a night light, air purifier, humidifier and aromatic diffuser. Canary Product mist fountains has the best mist maker machine, and produces twice the amount of mist with its 20mm disc. Key Features: • Our mist maker comes with an easy set-up tower, where you place the mist maker and place your splash guard over it. No more headaches with setting up the product.  • With its 12 color changing LED lights, it is designed to become the center piece of your room, as it continuously changes colors.  • WITH the new INLINE Control- you can set the color of your choice.  • RED, GREEN, BLUE colors • You can choose to alternate the colors • Set them in two different color variations, or just single color. • Or all together turn the lights off • IT comes with a re-designed and UL certified adapter so that it is small and does not take your whole outlet. • The changing LED Lamp generates comfortable & relaxing lighting. • When the water-level is low, the water-level sensor will automatically shut off the fogger unit.  • USE ONLY MINERALED WATER OR TAP WATER. Distilled water can reduce the effect of the mist or not allowed it to mist at all. Minerals in the water allows for the sensor to work, due to conductivity. • Use your favorite essential oil in this mist fountain. The essential oil MUST be water-soluble. • NEW and IMPROVED; comes with Inline control; 4 legs for better balance (instead of 3); and thicker better design glass • Patent pending inline control- can control hi-lo mist; several modes of lighting with options of on-off • It can be used as an aromatherapy diffuser, humidifier or night light • A great accent to any home, spa or office- comes with 12 LED lights, making any environment fun and beautiful NOTICE & CAUTION: • Please DO NOT hold or pick up the fogger unit with its water level sensor. DO NOT scratch or bump the water-level sensor as it could permanently damage the unit.  • Don't move the fogger unit or pull its cable while it's working. • Don't put your hand above the ceramic disc of the mist maker. The vibration can shock you, but it is not an electronic shock Package Included: • 1x Canary Tabletop Mist Fountain • Assembly Instruction & User Manual Warranty: Our fogger has a ONE YEAR HASSLE FREE WARRANTY simply email Canary Products. Please provide proof of purchase when claiming a warranty. If defective within 30 days, we will ship free of charge. If defective after 30 days, please make a payment for shipping only and the product will be sent free of charge. Note: PLEASE USE TAP WATER ONLY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814gwpDROtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Canary Products","source_asin":"B01L83UUA2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L83UUA2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L83UUA2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
