window.products.push({"id":770519,"name":"Mayan Arts Hummingbird, Beaded Ornamental Figurine, Good Luck Charm, Decorative Animals, Blue, Christmas Tree Ornaments, Holiday Decoration, Handmade ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ESeSp58eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This beaded hummingbird was created by a master bead artist in Santiago la Laguna, Guatemala, a village of mostly Mayan indigenous people along the shore of Lake Atitlan. Beading has made a tremendous difference in the lives of many indigenous Guatemalans. This colorful and whimsical hummingbird measures 2\" wide. When a hummingbird appears near you they are reflecting the positive side of life by showing you the joy in small things. It's important that you honor the small things in life and let go of the heavy toxic ones. – Be more present. ... The hummingbird is tireless in its pursuit for finding sweetness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ESeSp58eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mayan Arts","source_asin":"B081DB8WP1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081DB8WP1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081DB8WP1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":770520,"name":"Welcome to The Rivah Adirondack 18 x 13 Rectangular Double Applique Small Garden Flag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EMVO9XRJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Time to relax by the River, Southern style! anyone with a place next to a peaceful River will enjoy welcoming guests with this \"welcome to the rivah\" garden Flag. Size is 13 x 18 inches. Colorful nylon is appliqued to a heavy burlap-style fabric. The design is on both the front and back of this double-thickness Flag, increasing your display options! it's heavier and longer lasting than most flags, using a sturdy 360-denier nylon. Applique stitching is nicely detailed. This high quality, affordable Flag is an attractive investment in the beauty of your home and garden. (Flagpole not included.) Flag will retain its color and beauty for years if displayed in shade or semi-shade, and is rainproof.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EMVO9XRJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magnolia Garden","source_asin":"B01CIUHIRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770520","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CIUHIRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CIUHIRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":770521,"name":"Lipper International Acacia Slab Tree Bark Bowl, 10\" Diameter x 4.25\" Height, Single Bowl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gRTSmoKeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lipper International provides exceptionally valued items for the kitchen, home, office, and child's playroom. Known for their functionality and beauty, each of our products is individually crafted from the finest quality materials. These unique bowls are made from durable and acacia tree bark that is uniquely perfect for any decor. Use them to hold fruit, serve salads, or just to decorate around your home. Hand wash with a mild soap and cool water. Do not soak. Do not put in the dishwasher, microwave or refrigerator. Extreme changes in temperature will cause the material to crack over time. Dry thoroughly. Occasional use of mineral oil on the inside will help maintain its appearance. Accessories in images are not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gRTSmoKeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lipper International","source_asin":"B07C8YDFVG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C8YDFVG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C8YDFVG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":770522,"name":"Motivational Poster Motivational Pictures Posters Dr Martin Luther King Jr Poster Civil Rights Us History Posters Poster Motivational Quote Pictures P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yAfOWIE9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Martin Luther King Jr. (January 15, 1929 – April 4, 1968) was an American Baptist minister and activist who became the most visible spokesperson and leader in the civil rights movement from 1955 until his assassination in 1968. Born in Atlanta, King is best known for advancing civil rights through nonviolence and civil disobedience, tactics his Christian beliefs and the nonviolent activism of Mahatma Gandhi helped inspire. King led the 1955 Montgomery bus boycott and in 1957 became the first president of the Southern Christian Leadership Conference (SCLC). With the SCLC, he led an unsuccessful 1962 struggle against segregation in Albany, Georgia, and helped organize the nonviolent 1963 protests in Birmingham, Alabama. He also helped organize the 1963 March on Washington, where he delivered his famous \"I Have a Dream\" speech. On October 14, 1964, King won the Nobel Peace Prize for combating racial inequality through nonviolent resistance. In 1965, he helped organize the Selma to Montgomery marches. The following year, he and the SCLC took the movement north to Chicago to work on segregated housing. In his final years, he expanded his focus to include opposition towards poverty and the Vietnam War. He alienated many of his liberal allies with a 1967 speech titled \"Beyond Vietnam\". J. Edgar Hoover considered him a radical and made him an object of the FBI's COINTELPRO from 1963 on. FBI agents investigated him for possible communist ties, recorded his extramarital liaisons and reported on them to government officials, and on one occasion mailed King a threatening anonymous letter, which he interpreted as an attempt to make him commit suicide. MLK abraham lincoln poster nelson mandela religious historical drive poster jr maya angelou poster diversity posters dr martin luther king pyramid quotes wall poster malcolm x poster poster with quotes pictures with quotes shirt colin kaepernick","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yAfOWIE9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vincit Veritas","source_asin":"B07BNH4R8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770522","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BNH4R8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BNH4R8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
