window.products.push({"id":770571,"name":"The Scoopie Supplement Container, Scoop, and Funnel System for Post Workout Protein Powder, Spill Proof Holder Dispenser, Gym and Shaker Bottle Access","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jWpfCxpuL._SL1200_.jpg","description":"Make Storing, Scooping, and Mixing Drink Powders and Protein Powders Easier than Ever with The Scoopie When it comes to managing drink powders, preworkout powder, protein, or even bottle formula, it can be challenging to keep the just the right amount on you without spilling it while traveling or pouring it into a bottle or shaker. That’s why we created The Scoopie, a 3-in-1 portable supplement container, scoop, and funnel that makes it simply to fill your cup without spilling or making a mess. We’ve even included two different sizes in every pack which makes them a convenient on-the-go solution for workout supplements, baby formula, and even dry foods or snacks. An innovative design that lets you scoop, seal, and then pour it straight into a cup, it’s the convenient choice for athletes, fitness enthusiasts, and busy moms everywhere. Product Details: · Available in Multiple Sizes to Compliment Pre Workout Drinks and Post Workout Drinks · Airtight, Leak-Resistant Design · Scoop, Snap, and Pour System · Holds Up to 8 Ounces of Powder Making The Scoopie a Great Formula Container · Microwave and Dishwasher Safe · Prevents Workout Drink Spills and Messes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jWpfCxpuL._SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Scoopie","source_asin":"B07HC5FCG5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HC5FCG5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HC5FCG5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
