window.products.push({"id":770575,"name":"Inovayer Engagement Gifts Bridal Shower Gifts for Couple Wedding Countdown Calender Picture Frame Gifts Valentine‘s Day Present for Husband and Wife N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TZvo2RouL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💕Great Engagement Gifts: Perfect engagement gift for boyfriends and girlfriends. The engagement picture frame records every moment together. Cool engagement gift, perfect for your lover, on Engagement, Anniversaries, Christmas, Birthdays, or other special days, suitable for any occasion. 💕Countdown Frame: Are you looking forward to the arrival of the special day? The romantic countdown frame comes with quotes that \"XX days until Mr & Mrs.\", you can see exactly how many days are left until the big day, and makes your waiting easier. The countdown function brings you closer to your special day. Couples will be very surprised when they receive gifts. Best engaged gifts for her 💕Beautifully Decorated: The surface of the frame was decorated with two hearts of handmade cotton thread and diamond rings. This frame makes an excellent gift to announce your engagement to all your loved ones. It comes with a beautiful \"LET ❤ THE ADVENTURE BEGIN \" message that perfectly expresses any future bride and groom's expectations about the engagement. It is the best congratulations engagement gift for future bride and groom, engagement gifts for women. Great fiance gifts for her. 💕Premium Quality: The romantic photo frame is vintage brown and made of environmentally friendly wood, the surface of the love photo frame has a clear wood texture, and the frame baffle makes your photos visible, which can display your sweet and precious photos well and keep them for a long time. Come with 1 jute rope, bracket, and triangle hook, so this new home gifts frame is easy to hang on the wall or display on a dresser. This Gifts photo frame measures about 11.8 x 9.25 inches. 💕Exquisite Box Packaging: Love picture frames will come with a beautiful packaging gift box so that you could give it directly without spending time on the package, your lover will see its special value when she or he opens the gift. Great romantic engagement present, surprise a loved one with photo frames.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TZvo2RouL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inovayer","source_asin":"B0B18G7LJG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B18G7LJG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B18G7LJG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":770576,"name":"CGOLDENWALL Upgraded Oil Press Machine Automatic Oil Presser Cold Hot Press with Intelligent Control Panel/ LCD Touch Screen/ 6 Kinds of Temperatures ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bcRx0fcwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5.25 INCHES INTELLIGENT CONTROL PANEL & LCD TOUCH SCREEN -- In addition to adjusting the automatic/manual mode and pressing temperature, the LCD screen also clearly displays the working status, heating time, temperature level and mode of the oil press. 6-GEAR INTELLIGENT HEATER -- Our K28 oil press is equipped with a 6-Gear Intelligent Thermostat Heater. There are six operating temperatures available, namely Fire1/2/3/4/5/6 (140°/160°/180° /200°/220°/240°). You can choose the most suitable temperature according to different materials. COLD&HOT PRESSING -- Our oil expeller supports two modes of oil pressing: cold and hot. Cold pressing better retains the nutritional value of the oil; hot pressing can squeeze the oil more efficiently, and the oil will be pure and aromatic. BUILT-IN THRUST BEARING -- The thrust bearing of our K28 oil presser is built into the motor, fundamentally rejecting the edible oil being contaminated by the engine oil and metal powder, and greatly increasing the service life. WIDER PRESS RANGE & HIGHER OIL YIELD -- More than 24 kinds of materials, such as White Peanut(38-47% oil yield), Black Sesame(41-49% oil yield), Sunflower Seeds(35-48% oil yield), Walnut(50-60% oil yield), Almond(49-55% oil yield), Hemp Seeds(27-37% oil yield), Hazelnut(48-55% oil yield), Flaxseed(29-38% oil yield), etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bcRx0fcwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CGOLDENWALL","source_asin":"B07WD9677G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WD9677G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WD9677G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":770577,"name":"Ballcap Buddy - Original and Patented Hat Cleaner, Hat Washer for Washing Machine or Dishwasher, Cap Washer Frame for Flat & Curved Hats, Black, Made ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fV184rzFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CLEANS CAPS SAFELY & QUICKLY - This hat washer for baseball caps effectively cleans your caps without deforming them. Cleaning, drying, storing, and protecting your cap is easier than ever with this cap cleaner – a hat cleaner for baseball caps that’s great for flat and curved hats too. DURABLE & FLEXIBLE - Use it consistently for years! We crafted our patented baseball cap washer for washing machine, hat cage for washing machine from quality engineered polypropylene with optimal flexibility. Reinforced with firm construction, this baseball hat washer retains its shape. DESIGNED FOR UNIVERSAL USE - Our one-sized ball cap washer for washing machine, baseball hat cleaner is suitable for kids or adult caps. You can also use this as a hat rack, baseball cap holder, hat hanger, and cap organizer at home or in a suitcase while traveling, to keep your hat in pristine condition. WASHING MACHINE & DISHWASHER SAFE - Put 1 hat washing cage, cap washer for baseball caps in the washing machine one at a time. For safer hat wash, use the top rack of your dishwasher & avoid using a front-load/tumble-type washing machine. Do not put this cap cleaner for hats in the dryer. EFFORTLESS LOCK & UNLOCK FEATURE - This ball cap washer for washing machine, hat holder for washing machine has a double-hook latch and snap hinge construction. Just push the latches into the center bar of this baseball hat washer cage using your thumb, fit your cap into position, then unlock after cleaning. Easy to use hat cleaner for washing machine!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fV184rzFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BallcapBuddy","source_asin":"B00QHZ3WIE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QHZ3WIE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QHZ3WIE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
