window.products.push({"id":770581,"name":"All My Walls SWS00052 Artwork – from Hand Sanding Modern Home Decor Metal Sculpture Contemporary Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41h1FRA9hDL._AC_.jpg","description":"This 7 panel metal wall sculpture by artist Ash Carl will mesmerize you and your guests! The hand sanded finish on the metal creates a unique 3 dimensional effect. As you pass by, the artwork seemingly “moves” by reflecting any light in the room. Lighting brings out amazing movement and texture in each panel! paint is applies to protect the metal and it features an amazing array of colors and detail. These pieces cannot be justified by pictures. The reflections that are hand carved into each piece can only show there best qualities in person. If you are looking for other color combinations, check out the other 80 designs of painted metal wall art by Ash Carl. Ash's artwork is collected by thousands worldwide and is MADE IN THE USA!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41h1FRA9hDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All My Walls","source_asin":"B001ND6GOW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001ND6GOW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001ND6GOW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":770582,"name":"PEIZI 20oz Tumbler with lid, Stainless Steel Double Wall Vacuum Insulated Travel Mug, Durable Powder Coated Coffee Cup, Black, 8 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SvHfKFU1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A WONDERFUL GIFT FOR EVERYONE: For those who love outdoor activities such as hiking and camping, the sturdy, portable and heat-retaining tumbler can definately meet your needs. For those who spend lots of time commuting to the office, it allow you take your time drinking your morning brew on the go. For those who enjoy BBQs, birthday parties and festival celebrations, it is a stylish and practical gift prepared for you and your family! PREMIUM INSULATED COFFEE TUMBLER: Double wall vacuum insulated prevent heat transfer to the outer walls of the tumbler, condensation free and long lasting. Great for all beverages, keeps hot drinks (like hot Coffee) up to 3 hours and cold (like Iced Water, Coffee or Coca) up to 9 hours. So you could enjoy your beverage cold or hot by the pool, take your cup of joe on the go. PREMIUM MATERIAL: The tumbler is made from high quality 18/8 304 food grade stainless steel. Lead free and durable. Rust-proof, easy wash, dishwasher safe and unbreakable. When washing, our tumbler is BPA Free so you are safe from toxins. SUPERIOR PEARLIZED COATED FINISH: Sweat proof, outside stays dry, easy grip. Electro-polished interior doesn't transfer flavor & no metal aftertaste, you don't have to worry about your morning coffee or afternoon teas being ruined. Designed for car cup holders. 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION: We provide 100% satisfaction after sale service, if there is anything wrong with your order, please enter our store and email us, we will make every effort to solve your problem. We are happy to provide 100% money back if you are not fully satisfied with the tumbler.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SvHfKFU1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PEIZI","source_asin":"B08BS5BF4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BS5BF4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BS5BF4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
