window.products.push({"id":770658,"name":"FINE DRAGON Robot Vacuum, High Suction, Robotic Vacuum Cleaner with Drop-Sensing Technology and HEPA Style Filter for Pet Fur and Allergens, Designed ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GVtNNhyTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"FINE DRAGON is a manufactory with high quality products and good customer service. Our product lines consist of many categories of household including cordless electric floor cleaner, window cleaner, kitchen & bathroom cleaner and more. We have successfully launched our products in over 30 countries. Product Features: This electric sweeping cleaner is designed especially for hardwood or tile floor not for carpet.  Easily to learn and operate. Just press the power button lightly, then the cleaner will get down to clean at once.  Cliff Sensor: Item with cliff sensor to detect the stairs to avoid falling down.  Suitable for hard flat floor, cement, ceramic tile, hardwood floor, etc. Parameters: Type: Robot Vacuum Cleaner  Material: New ABS  Vacuum Suction: 860 Pa Charging Voltage: Ac110-240V (50HZ-60HZ) Battery capacity (mA): 2100mAh/10.8V Operating ideal time: 120min  Full charging time: 3-4 hours Capacity (ML): 0.4L Dust Box Capacity Package Contents: 1 * Vacuum Cleaner Robot 1 * Corner Brush  1 * Charger Adapter 1 * User manual Note: - The sweeping cleaner has automatic sweeping function, but No vacuuming function available. Please use our sweeper on flat floor like hardwood floor, tiles, marbles and etc. It can’t work on any carpet. - The robot cannot climbs over objects, so it cannot transitions from floor type to other floor type (eg. from hard floors to carpet). It may get stuck in the connection slope between different floor types. When it comes to the connection, be sure to help it cross.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GVtNNhyTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FINE DRAGON","source_asin":"B01FS67F4E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770658","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FS67F4E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FS67F4E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
