window.products.push({"id":770678,"name":"Down & Feather Co. Toddler Travel Pillow – Quality Rest","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TKO-8+F-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is a Quality Rest down pillow? Our Quality Rest 600 Fill Power Collection of RDS Certified European White Goose Down pillows is made in our BlueSign approved facility here in the United States. The first of its kind. RDS Certified down was proposed by The North Face, adopted globally by Textile Exchange and Control Union, to provide transparency to our customers that we are filling our luxurious down bedding with the finest most humanely sourced down in the world. How does it feel? You will sleep more \"in\" this pillow than \"on\" this pillow. Even our FIRM and EXTRA FIRM pillow will feel soft, light and resilient giving you years of comfort. We have removed all the feathers that could poke you leaving behind only the soft, light European white goose down clusters to cradle your head. The shell is long staple Egyptian cotton woven into a luxurious sateen weave so it feels soft on your face and skin. It feels both soft to the touch and light in your hand with a beautifully elegant sheen. How long will it last? Still made with our legendary German milled Long-staple Egyptian cotton shells that will last a lifetime when properly covered with a pillow protector or pillow case. Long-staple Egyptian cotton is the finest cotton in the world. Only Oeko-Tex certified German milled fabrics are used to make our Quality Rest brand of goose down filled pillows. The shells are guaranteed down proof and our RDS Certified European goose down is Guaranteed hypoallergenic with no feathers to poke you. Finished with a satin corded edge your new pillow could become a family heirloom.DRY CLEAN ONLY. IMPORTANT: You probably have NEVER slept on an all goose down pillow before. Very few have. Our all goose down pillows are very soft and very light weight. You will sleep more \"in\" this pillow than \"on\" this pillow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TKO-8+F-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Down & Feather Co.","source_asin":"B01M0JFLH4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M0JFLH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M0JFLH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
