window.products.push({"id":770759,"name":"Rzoysia 2pc Kitchen Mats Anti Fatigue Mat for Kitchen Floor Kitchen Rugs Runner Standing Desk Mat Non-Slip for Home Kitchen Office 60\"x17.3\"+28\"x17.3\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BYLMZ+0JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[A Set of 2] Come and get 2 anti fatigue floor mats at 1 purchase. The small floor mat is 17.3\" x 28\" and the larger one is 17.3” x 60”. You can flexibly place them in different situations based on your needs. These elegant mats with marble patterns can perfectly match your home decors and enhance the style. [Thick Cushioned Anti Fatigue Mats] Our anti fatigue mats use soft memory foam which can reduce your lower back pressure, provide adequate support for your feet and joints and release your fatigue from long-time standing. The 0.5” extra thick anti fatigue floor mats can be used as your standing desk mat or kitchen floor mat while you are cooking. [Durable & Non-skid] Our kitchen floor mats’ surface made of high quality PU leather is waterproof, stain resistant, odorless and crease-free. Thanks to the fine texture and the super non-slip bottom, the comfort floor mat can always stay in its place. Super easy to clean and durable for long time use. [Robot Vacuum Friendly] Our anti fatigue kitchen runners are designed with beveled edges. It can prevent you from tripping and has no trouble for robot vacuums and the wheelchair bound to get over the mats. [Versatile Application] Our comfort standing mats are the most practical combination and can be used separately in different situations like kitchen, laundry room, study offices, etc. Our elegant-looking kitchen mats for floor can also suit most floors like tile and hardwood floor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BYLMZ+0JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rzoysia","source_asin":"B092DDTCCH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092DDTCCH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092DDTCCH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":770760,"name":"Mosaic Flower Vase Handmade Decorative Crackle Glass Tall Silver vase House Decor Table Centerpieces Modern Gifts for Home Holiday Anniversary Celebra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jOGZ5WjYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★【STURDY&THICKENED GLASS HANDMADE MOSAIC VASE】:The glass vase made of tempered cracked glass, double thickened glass ensures that the vase is solid, 100% handmade mosaic glass craftsmanship will glam your table and offers a decorative accent to any space.Compared with the ceramic vase, tempered Vases are shinier, absolutely an eye-catching item in your home. ★【APPROPRIATE SIZE】: Vase measured height 16”, Straight cylinder shape in 4.1” diameter, which is perfect for a small space. Both fresh flowers bouquets, dried flowers, artificial flowers, and green plants are applicable, whether modern or rustic style can perfectly match your home ★【100% HANDMADE MOSAIC PIECES】:As the vase is all handmade we can avoid if there’s any places not perfect. Also every single item will not exactly the same as the other. Maybe will have problems missing pieces by accident, or glue mark, please no worry just contact aftersales we will make it right. ★【STUNNING DESIGN FOR ANY SCENES】: Placing this precious mosaic vase atop decorative mirrors and chandelier centerpiece risers. It will glam your wedding tables or coffee table decorative and offers a vibrant decorative accent to any space.Cracked glass vases are perfect for home or office decoration, the elegant vase decor can be placed in the living room, balcony, entrance, bedroom, or study. Also, the unique vase can be an ideal gift for your friends and families. ★【SAFE PACKING】: The small vase is safely packaged with bubble bag meanwhile polystyrene foam on the top and bottom. If the vase came damaged, please contact us at any time we will solve this problem for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jOGZ5WjYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BORUNDA","source_asin":"B09Q15LMWX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q15LMWX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q15LMWX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
