window.products.push({"id":770784,"name":"Le Cadeaux Milano Teal 4 Piece Shatter Proof Tumbler Glass Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vGp6-HX8L._AC_.jpg","description":"4 piece set of break resistant polycarbonate glassware. Set includes: Four (4) Tumblers hold 13 fl oz. To coordinate with Le Cadeaux melamine dinnerware, these new polycarbonate (i. e. plastic) drinking sets are just the ticket. Perfect for al fresco or casual indoor entertaining. Lead and cadmium free, break resistant, lightweight, dishwasher safe, NOT microwave safe. Polycarbonate is a versatile, tough plastic used for a variety of applications, from bulletproof windows to compact disks (CDs). The main advantage of polycarbonate over other types of plastic is unbeatable strength combined with light weight. While acrylic is 17% stronger than glass, polycarbonate is nearly unbreakable. Bulletproof windows and enclosures as seen inside banks or at drive-throughs are often made of polycarbonate. Add to this the advantage that polycarbonate is just one-third the weight of acrylic, or one-sixth as heavy as glass.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vGp6-HX8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Cadeaux","source_asin":"B00C6BRT1O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C6BRT1O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C6BRT1O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
