window.products.push({"id":770886,"name":"BENREN Mini Tiny Modern Cuckoo Clock, Modern Cuckoo Wall Clock, Cute Kids Room Clock for Living Room Bedroom, Silent Quartz Clock,White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":163.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Fzqr472NL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A vintage and beautiful clock that is sure to bring you and your family a different kind of joy!DESCRIPTION:Outer finish: Multi-layer matt lacquer;Two D battery operated quartz movement, batteries not included.ADDITIONAL FEATURES:Hand carved decorations;A moving cuckoo bird and swinging pendulum;Automatic night sensor;INSTRUCTION:Remove the back door and insert the batteries.Hang the clock securely on the wall.Hang the pendulum and the decorations onto its' hangers.Turn the minute hand clockwise, until the clock reads the correct time. (Important: Let the cuckoo bird call each full hour before proceeding to the next. If not chime on time, pull out the minute hand vertically when chimed, and then reset to 12).If the time the cuckoo shows does not correspond with the number of cuckoo bird calls please use the ADJUST button and proceed as follows: for example, when the time is 6 o’clock, if the cuckoo calls twice, consecutive press ADJUST button 4 times.The sound switch has three functions: ON (loud sound), LOW (low sound) and OFF (no sound).Product dimensions (without pendulum and weights) 12.6 x 18.9 x 5.1 inchesProduct weight: 5.5 lbs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Fzqr472NL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BENREN","source_asin":"B08L3PC6Z4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770886","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L3PC6Z4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L3PC6Z4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
