window.products.push({"id":770918,"name":"Folding Mattress, 79x44x3 inches (LxWxH), 100% Natural Kapok Filling, Day Bed, Folding Guest Mattress, fold up Mattress,Guest Bed, Foldable Cushion, R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l7V7G72VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kapok folding mattress (guest mattress) made of pure kapok Kapok folding mattresses from livasia are perfectly suited as a relaxation mat or as a guest mattress. Thanks to the unique kapok filling, the mattress is made for daily use. Whether as a mattress for a midday nap, as a relaxation meadow, or as a guest bed: our quick-folding mattresses are immediately ready for use.  The folding mattresses are also perfectly suited as a yoga mat, which you can use for your exercises and find peace. The beautiful colors and patterns also serve to relax. You will bring the holiday feeling directly to your home with our colorful folding mattresses. Unique kapok filling: Kapok of the kapok tree Our Thai cushions are also suitable for outside areas, because we have the cushions firmly filled with kapok. Due to this special plant fiber, no cold from the ground comes through. The fiber has a pleasant insulating effect in the summer. Kapok is a pure vegetable product, which we use untreated and natural for the filling. Our cushions are handmade in selected family companies and only natural and sustainable materials are used.  Our Thai cushions are filled with 100% kapok and have durable cotton covers made of pure cotton. Product information Size of the mattress: folded; 44x20x12 inches (LxWxH), unfolded: 79x44x3 inches (LxWxH) Size of the mattress: folded; 44x20x12 inches (LxWxH), unfolded: 79x44x3 inches (LxWxH) Weight of the mattress: 24 LB Weight of the mattress: 24 LB Filling: 100% natural kapok of the kapok tree Filling: 100% natural kapok of the kapok tree Cover: 100% cotton. We only use pure and very durable cotton Cover: 100% cotton. We only use pure and very durable cotton Our Thai cushions are handmade in selected family companies and imported by us directly without intermediaries! Our Thai cushions are handmade in selected family companies and imported by us directly without intermediaries!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l7V7G72VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LivAsia","source_asin":"B072K7SD9K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072K7SD9K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072K7SD9K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
