window.products.push({"id":770956,"name":"1Easylife Dish Drying Rack, 2-Tier Compact Drainboard Set, Large Rust-Proof Drainer with Utensil /Cutting Board Holder for Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sre-6rGFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 TIER DISH RACK for SPACE SAVING - The compact dish drying rack includes 1 dish rack, 1 Utensil Holder, 1 knife and cutlery holder, 1 cutting board holder, and 2 Removable Drain Board. All the parts can be dissembled and washable and dishwasher friendly so you can clean and sanitize them occasionally. It’s designed to save space in your cooking and cleaning area. A must-have for any kitchen which accompany your needs during hand washing your dishes and drinkware LARGE CAPACITY - Suitable for Store Cups Bowls Dishes and Other Kitchen Utensils. Make the most use out of your countertop with the kitchen 2 tier dish rack. The first tier can hold fruits, vegetables, coffee pots and hold up to 15 plates. The second tier can hold up bowls, plates, bottles and hold up to 18 bowls which are perfect for your limited kitchen countertop. Measures: 16.53\" X 16.1\" X 9.84\". The Drainer provides wide storage space for kitchen small pots, frying pans and various bowls TOP STAINLESS STELL MATERIAL - The dish rack made with top quality steel with high temperature baking varnish. It is no problem to contact food appliances. It also prevents dish rack from rust, ensure its long-lasting durability. The anti-slip foot cover at the bottom is designed to keep stable, not easy to shake. It is durable and rough, suitable for long time use. No worry about the counter mess at all. BEARING STRONG and STABLE: Heavy-duty metal frame can hold up to 50lbs. We made this dish drainer as sturdy as possible. So there will be no wiggles and wobbles bringing your plates crashing down. The draining tray keeps countertops dry. While the Utensil Utensil organizes and holds forks, spoons, knives, and other serving utensils. SUPER EASY TO ASSEMBLY: You will get detailed installation instructions for this large dish drying rack. All parts, tools, and instructions needed are included. The draining tableware rack is detachable and easy to clean. We provide 12 monthly warranty and friendly customer service. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sre-6rGFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"1Easylife","source_asin":"B0C36G9FCN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-770956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C36G9FCN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C36G9FCN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
